      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">Automotive Tire Management Technologies, Jaxicloud’s supplier, has provided tire management solutions to the automotive industry for over 25 years. With over 500M TPMS sensors in the field today, we are one of the leading TPMS providers. We continue to innovate, bringing next-generation technology to market, including Bluetooth Low Energy communications, tire-mounted sensor hardware, and virtual sensors, enabling insights beyond pressure and temperature. See JaxiCloud Automotive Tire Management Solutions</p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">WE LEAD THE WAY</span></strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">in developing breakthrough technologies that make vehicles safer, cleaner, more efficient and more connected. Our highly developed devices deliver: unsurpassed quality, the lowest life cycle costs, the longest product life.</p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>BRING US YOUR TOUGHEST ENGINEERING CHALLENGES</strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">We will work with you, engineer to engineer, to help you maximize performance and value. Our advanced sensor technology helps provide breakthrough capabilities in these systems and others: Engine, Exhaust, Transmission, Chassis &amp; Safety, Cabin Comfort, Tire Pressure Monitoring.</p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><strong>MISSION CRITICAL COMPONENTS</strong></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">for hybrid, fuel cell and electric vehicles. Jaxicloud is a leading provider of innovative solutions and components used to provide secure and reliable data.</p>",
      "bodyText": "Automotive Tire Management Technologies, Jaxicloud’s supplier, has provided tire management solutions to the automotive industry for over 25 years. With over 500M TPMS sensors in the field today, we are one of the leading TPMS providers. We continue to innovate, bringing next-generation technology to market, including Bluetooth Low Energy communications, tire-mounted sensor hardware, and virtual sensors, enabling insights beyond pressure and temperature. See JaxiCloud Automotive Tire Management SolutionsWE LEAD THE WAYin developing breakthrough technologies that make vehicles safer, cleaner, more efficient and more connected. Our highly developed devices deliver: unsurpassed quality, the lowest life cycle costs, the longest product life.BRING US YOUR TOUGHEST ENGINEERING CHALLENGESWe will work with you, engineer to engineer, to help you maximize performance and value. Our advanced sensor technology helps provide breakthrough capabilities in these systems and others: Engine, Exhaust, Transmission, Chassis & Safety, Cabin Comfort, Tire Pressure Monitoring.MISSION CRITICAL COMPONENTSfor hybrid, fuel cell and electric vehicles. Jaxicloud is a leading provider of innovative solutions and components used to provide secure and reliable data.",
